7592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372049 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372049 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186372051 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372049 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b231bed0-a79c-51f5-8734-2ba409222c93" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372050 #edb/ref 1080 "F(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,i-{e}^{y}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,j" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372050 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372050 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9de0e353-ab6e-59bc-a0ed-36c03e15387b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372051 #edb/ref 1080 "F(x,y)=-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,i+(-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+1)\\,j" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372051 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372051 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3a8be957-5e7a-5c11-9e63-50310cedd0c8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372052 #edb/ref 1080 "F(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,i+({e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+1)\\,j" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372052 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372052 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "42f0507b-1475-5ce6-b8db-506235509208" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372053 #edb/ref 1080 "F(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,i-(\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+1)\\,j" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372053 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372053 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5aa5c9a6-5913-5d25-b0d5-b24f5f1a2717" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372054 #edb/ref 1080 "F(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,i+({e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y-1)\\,j" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372054 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372054 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7729c754-88f0-530c-869b-5bdc5168a17b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372062 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186372063 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372062 #edb/ref 1069 "q-162518" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372062 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372062 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following is a stream function for the vector field\n$F(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,i-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,j?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372062 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "9fb4a1a9-80b2-5c9b-b44c-5418f559f461" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372062 #edb/ref 1074 "A vector field $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ with a simply connected domain $D⊆{R}^{2}$ has a stream function $ψ(x,y)$ if and only if\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=0.\n$$\n\nNote that $F(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,i-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,j$ is a vector field with simply connected domain $D={R}^{2},$ where $P(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y$ and $Q(x,y)=-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y.$ Computing the partial derivatives, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $F$ has a stream function, since\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+(-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y)=0.\n$$\n\nNext, we find a stream function. A function $ψ(x,y)$ is a stream function of the vector field $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ if \n\n$$\nP=\\frac{∂ψ}{∂y},\\,Q=-\\frac{∂ψ}{∂x}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂ψ}{∂y}={e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y,\\,\\frac{∂ψ}{∂x}={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y.\n$$\n\nIntegrating these equations, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y+f(x),\\,ψ(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y+g(y)\n$$\n\nwhere $f$ and $g$ are arbitrary functions. Finally, setting $f=g=0,$ we have\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372063 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372064 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372063 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372065 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372063 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186372066 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186372063 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 175921